---
// Article for the Small Text page (id). The tool above it comes from SmallPage.
import SmallPage from '../../components/SmallPage.astro';
---

<SmallPage lang="id">
  <article class="wrap max-w-[900px] mx-auto py-10 text-text">
    <!-- Styles -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">Gaya Teks Mini untuk Disalin dan Ditempel</h2>
      <p class="mb-5 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted">Teks kecil juga disebut teks mini atau font mini. Agar bio, username, dan pesan media sosialmu menonjol, gaya penulisan ini disebut superskrip, small caps, dan subskrip.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SS</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ᵗⁱⁿʸ</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Superskrip</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Huruf mini yang terangkat di atas garis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SC</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ᴛɪɴʏ</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Small Caps</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Huruf kapital mini setinggi huruf kecil.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SB</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ₜᵢₙy</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Subskrip</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Huruf mini yang turun di bawah garis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Cara Menggunakan Generator Teks Mini</h2>
      <ol class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Ketik teksmu.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Masukkan nama, bio, atau frasa apa pun ke kotak di atas untuk langsung mengecilkan hurufmu.</span></p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">2</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Pilih gaya mini.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Pilih antara superskrip (ᵗⁱⁿʸ), subskrip (ₜᵢₙy), atau small caps (ᴛɪɴʏ) untuk menemukan tampilan mini yang pas.</span></p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">3</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Salin dan tempel.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Klik gaya favoritmu untuk menyalinnya.</span></p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Alphabets -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">Alfabet Huruf Teks Kecil</h2>
      <p class="mb-5 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted">Untuk menyalinnya, gunakan SS, SC, dan SB secara berurutan seperti contoh di bawah:</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SS</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Superskrip (huruf mini terangkat)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ᵃ ᵇ ᶜ ᵈ ᵉ ᶠ ᵍ ʰ ⁱ ʲ ᵏ ˡ ᵐ ⁿ ᵒ ᵖ q ʳ ˢ ᵗ ᵘ ᵛ ʷ ˣ ʸ ᶻ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SC</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Small caps (huruf kapital mini)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ᴀ ʙ ᴄ ᴅ ᴇ ꜰ ɢ ʜ ɪ ᴊ ᴋ ʟ ᴍ ɴ ᴏ ᴘ ǫ ʀ s ᴛ ᴜ ᴠ ᴡ x ʏ ᴢ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SB</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Subskrip (huruf mini turun)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ₐ ₑ ₕ ᵢ ⱼ ₖ ₗ ₘ ₙ ₒ ₚ ᵣ ₛ ₜ ᵤ ᵥ ₓ</p>
        <p class="mt-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-2 px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-text-muted"><strong class="text-text">Catatan:</strong> Standar Unicode tidak menyertakan huruf subskrip asli untuk b, c, d, f, g, q, w, dan z.</p>
      </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SS</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Angka Superskrip</h3></div>
          <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">⁰ ¹ ² ³ ⁴ ⁵ ⁶ ⁷ ⁸ ⁹</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SB</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Angka Subskrip</h3></div>
          <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">₀ ₁ ₂ ₃ ₄ ₅ ₆ ₇ ₈ ₉</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-center text-2xl font-bold">Pertanyaan yang Sering Diajukan</h2>
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-3">
      <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[.95rem] font-medium">
          Apakah font kecil ini bisa dipakai di Facebook, Twitter, Tumblr, dan YouTube?
          <span class="shrink-0 text-text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted">Ya, kamu bisa memakai huruf kecil ini di Facebook, Twitter (X), Tumblr, dan YouTube karena terbuat dari simbol Unicode universal.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[.95rem] font-medium">
          Bisakah saya memakai huruf mini di username Instagram?
          <span class="shrink-0 text-text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted">Username Instagram hanya menerima huruf standar, angka, titik, dan garis bawah, jadi simbol Unicode tidak akan berfungsi. Namun, kamu bebas memakainya di kolom Nama, Bio, dan keterangan.</p>
      </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</SmallPage>
